    "body": "Body-only change by the coordinator of NeoTech (2026-11-27). The maintainer approved it (question dialog of today: \"We fix and merge\"), because `main` is red and the cut of v0.28.0 waits for this fix. Nothing was pushed to the branch; the head is `e24f6bacf` as before.\n\nWhat changed: one line is added at the end of the PR body, `Fixes #4431`. The line `Refs #4400` stays.\n\nWhy this line: the review of 18:33Z asks for a closing line at the end of the body. Its text says `Fixes #4405`, but #4405 is this PR. The open issue for this failure is #4431 (\"main is red\", the two `wire_post` tests, runs 46058127364 and 46065396255). Issue #4400 is closed.\n\nThe body now waits for a re-review at the same head. Then the coordinator merges this PR; the maintainer approved that too.",
